<title>Tombol pintasan</title>

<p>This page provides an overview of keyboard shortcuts that can help you
use <app>Evolution</app> more efficiently.</p>

<note style="tip">
<p>In addition to the shortcuts listed below, you can also use accelerators to navigate with the keyboard.</p> 
<p>Hold down the <key>Alt</key> key to reveal <em>accelerators</em>:
underlined letters on menu items, buttons, and other controls. Press
<key>Alt</key> plus the underlined letter to activate a control, just
as if you had clicked on it.</p>
</note>


<section id="global">
<title>Global</title>
<table rules="rows" frame="top bottom">
  <tr xml:id="global-ctrl-1">
    <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>1</key></keyseq></p></td>
    <td><p>Pilih komponen Surel.</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr xml:id="global-ctrl-2">
    <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>2</key></keyseq></p></td>
    <td><p>Pilih komponen Kontak.</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr xml:id="global-ctrl-3">
    <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>3</key></keyseq></p></td>
    <td><p>Pilih komponen Kalender.</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr xml:id="global-ctrl-4">
    <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>4</key></keyseq></p></td>
    <td><p>Pilih komponen Tugas.</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr xml:id="global-ctrl-5">
    <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>5</key></keyseq></p></td>
    <td><p>Pilih komponen Memo.</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr xml:id="global-ctrl-n">
    <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>N</key></keyseq></p></td>
    <td><p>Membuat butir baru di komponen saat ini.</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr xml:id="global-f6">
    <td><p><key>F6</key></p></td>
    <td><p>Memutar fokus antar panel.</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr xml:id="global-shift-ctrl-q">
    <td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>Q</key></keyseq></p></td>
    <td><p>Membersihkan bilah pencarian.</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr xml:id="global-ctrl-w">
    <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>W</key></keyseq></p></td>
    <td><p>Menutup jendela.</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr xml:id="global-shift-ctrl-w">
    <td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>W</key></keyseq></p></td>
    <td><p>Buka jendela baru.</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr xml:id="global-ctrl-q">
    <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>Q</key></keyseq></p></td>
    <td><p>Keluar dari <app>Evolution</app>.</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr xml:id="global-ctrl-p">
    <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>P</key></keyseq></p></td>
    <td><p>Mencetak pilihan.</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr xml:id="global-ctrl-s">
    <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>S</key></keyseq></p></td>
    <td><p>Menyimpan pilihan.</p></td>
  </tr>
  <tr xml:id="global-del">
    <td><p><key>Del</key> atau <key>Backspace</key></p></td>
    <td><p>Menghapus pilihan.</p></td>
